  "details": "Give us Christmas category allready.\nPlease add the Christmas category in VRChat allready devs.\nYou are way ahead of any other season. But Christmas last year was so dissapointing how late you were out with it.\nBy the time it came out last year Christmas was just about over and we barely had time to properly enjoy christmas themed worlds.\nGive us the category allready so we can enjoy the christmas themed worlds better and easier find them and get in the jolly mood.\nAnd please do like you do with other seasons like halloween and start the category early instead of super late.",
